":false,"text":"夜鷹と出会ってからは《廃楽園》の長女として、相変わらず破天荒に暮らしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"使用する《セルデバイス》はハンディチェーンソー。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"欲望に忠実で我儘。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20706","sourceWorkId":"27101","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"個体番号はNF888。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"小麦畑色の髪と、青い瞳を持つ少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大食いで絶倫で口が悪い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"セーラー巫女服は《アサクサ》で買った。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"《戦艦バオバブ》から逃げ出し、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"《封鎖区域》ではスラムのボスを務めていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"夜鷹と出会ってからは《廃楽園》の長女として、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"相変わらず破天荒に暮らしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"使用する《セルデバイス》はハンディチェーンソー。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"欲望に忠実で我儘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「人類の大地だって？全くおこがましいったら無いね！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"77145"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/27/2702c988f5fe09d3e36e0d5f405dd0e2d56f69b7fd01087cb828a77eac9339b2.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4a/4a953ad8071a5ea89ab17d3ad6a9fed4eba1e757a8a51383a8841ecf048bdfd8.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小澤みのり","creatorId":"vndb:s15910","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s15910","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s15910","name":"小澤 みのり","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:263799:77145:32659:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c76170","characterName":"フロッピー","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"77146","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"263799"}],"egsCharacterIds":["20707"],"vndbCharacterId":"c76170"},"originalCharacterName":"フロッピー","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"gender":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"n"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Oh, are you sleeping there again? I can’t imagine you’ll sleep well like that...\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Loved by all as the selfless housemother of Lost Eden, she is a goddess of domestic chores thanks to deft gadget manipulation."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Though a cute pet robot now, she was once an electric SHEEP."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She may be a first-rate mom, but as a SHEEP, she’s scrap metal."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Says things like, \"My oh my!\" in soft-spoken, ladylike tones."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Steam"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c76170"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"みんなから愛される《廃楽園》の優しいお母さん。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"機械を巧みに操る家事の天才。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今のガワは小さなペットロボットだが、昔は《電気羊》だったらしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お母さんとしては一流だが《電気羊》としてはジャンク品。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"柔らかな女性の声色で「あらあらまあまあ」と、おしとやかに喋る。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20707","sourceWorkId":"27101","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"みんなから愛される《廃楽園》の優しいお母さん。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"機械を巧みに操る家事の天才。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今のガワは小さなペットロボットだが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"昔は《電気羊》だったらしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お母さんとしては一流だが《電気羊》としてはジャンク品。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"柔らかな女性の声色で「あらあらまあまあ」と、おしとやかに喋る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「あらあら、大丈夫？そこで布団敷いてちょっと寝転ぶ？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"77146"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d0/d0337f21249b00de34cc5e803a30daf1a936bc3ea5ed272863a45da68469c493.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/74/7456796c65a92beade174c6b4b5698dea8137b2c837203c7072b9e8e40940fa7.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"田中茉理花","creatorId":"vndb:s2571","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2571","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2571","name":"田中 茉理花","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:263799:77146:15994:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c76171","characterName":"ヴァネッサ・メスキダ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"77147","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"263799"}],"egsCharacterIds":["20708"],"vndbCharacterId":"c76171"},"originalCharacterName":"ヴァネッサ・メスキダ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"I don’t care if you feel bad or not. What I wanna know is, where’s your apology?\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A brigadier general with the STX Space Force."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Tough to be around and a raging narcissist at the best of times, she treats Gon like a servant, although he never seems to complain."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Once active on the front lines as an elite pilot alongside Ichizo, she now spends her days hunting down this \"disgraced fugitive\"."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Steam"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c76171"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"《STX軍》に所属する女性。階級は准将。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"キツい性格でかなりのドＳ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"童顔だが、わりといい歳の大人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"かつて夜鷹一蔵と共に精鋭操縦士として前線で活躍していた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現在は軍から逃亡した夜鷹一蔵を追っているらしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ネオフェネックの「ゴン」を奴隷のように可愛がっている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20708","sourceWorkId":"27101","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"《STX軍》に所属する女性。階級は准将。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"キツい性格でかなりのドS。童顔だが、わりといい歳の大人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"かつて夜鷹一蔵と共に精鋭操縦士として前線で活躍していた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現在は軍から逃亡した夜鷹一蔵を追っているらしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ネオフェネックの「ゴン」を奴隷のように可愛がっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「余計なこと言ってんじゃないわよーッ!!」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"77147"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/04/0418b1c2315f56833c513c3bf9256c34dce62174a2673e31b76ff9f5c3bd666c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a6/a694995bce74139c19f215f2a4bb71bc4457c9b0875c18ac245c1c44e7b2f09a.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"栗原雅子","creatorId":"vndb:s298","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s298","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s298","name":"野月 まひる","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:263799:77147:6570:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c76172","characterName":"ジャン・レグルス","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"77149","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"263799"}],"egsCharacterIds":["20710"],"vndbCharacterId":"c76172"},"originalCharacterName":"ジャン・レグルス","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"I heard you haven’t been eating. Here, it’s a surprise present, just for you...\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A researcher at the STX Space Force’s R&D Center, he is the creator and father figure to all of neo-fennec kind. He is friendly from a distance, but given to icy stares, hence the moniker \"Hatred-Digesting Boa Constrictor.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hates Ichizo for nominating a certain young pilot for the \"Honorable Interstellar Plan\" of 339 UBE."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He ostensibly oversees neo-fennec population control, but in secret, he is investigating a 5th-dimensional ghost on Battleship Baobab said to drift through the library of time."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Steam"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c76172"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"《STX軍》の開発センターに所属する科学者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"《ネオフェネック》の生みの親。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一見人当りの良さそうな顔をしているが《憎悪飲み込むウワバミ》と呼ばれ、恐れられている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"《名誉のインターステラー計画》に参加する精鋭を推薦した夜鷹一蔵を憎んでおり、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ネオフェネックの数を管理しながら、裏で《戦艦バオバブ》を駆け巡る《五次元オバケ》を追っている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20710","sourceWorkId":"27101","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"とても気さくで心優しい科学者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"モノリス研究の片手間、遺伝子工学に手を出しているらしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"アントワーヌ・ド・サガンとは幼馴染みで兄代わり。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"同期の夜鷹一蔵と仲が良い。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20710","sourceWorkId":"29088","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"《STX軍》の開発センターに所属する科学者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"《ネオフェネック》の生みの親。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一見人当りの良さそうな顔をしているが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"《憎悪飲み込むウワバミ》と呼ばれ、恐れられている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"《名誉のインターステラー計画》に参加する精鋭を推薦した夜鷹一蔵を憎んでおり、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ネオフェネックの数を管理しながら、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"裏で《戦艦バオバブ》を駆け巡る《五次元オバケ》を追っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「俺からキミに贈る、とっておきのサプライズだ」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"77149"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/dc/dc3b15f1590e7046d281e66dd60d33b44465e8898069ca3d77e0d1e68e390ce0.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5c/5ca5bdd92fe72970ba32b5badd97109e44a43076aa62d1d0eec997d14cf046aa.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"古河徹人","creatorId":"vndb:s299","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s299","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s299","name":"古河 徹人","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:263799:77149:6265:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c76173","characterName":"オリジン","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[],"egsCharacterIds":["20711","22580"],"vndbCharacterId":"c76173"},"originalCharacterName":"オリジン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Understood. Now searching with the Black Canvas...\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Neo-fennec no. ???"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A mysterious lady indeed and Regulus’s personal secretary who can remains calm and composed, no matter her situation."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Immaculate yet approachable, with the kindest of smiles, she is never seen without her Black Canvas seldevice, which was given to her by Regulus himself."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A sucker for cheese and salty blue boudin sausages."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from ALPHA-NIGHTHAWK and BETA-SIXDOUZE Steam's pages"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c76173"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"他のネオフェネックと違って個体番号が無い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"レグルスの秘書をしている清楚なお姉さん。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"レグルスから《ブラックキャンバス》を与えられ、肌身離さず持ち歩いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"優しそうな微笑みを浮かべ、いつも冷静な面持ち。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20711","sourceWorkId":"27101","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"サガンが大切にしているフェネック。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"開発センターで飼われている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"チーズや塩辛いブルーブーダンソーセージが大好き。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20711","sourceWorkId":"29088","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ミステリアスなアパートの管理人さん。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ニックネームは持たない主義。個体番号はヒミツ。ついでに年齢も秘密。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"謎の黒い板をタブレット型デバイスと言い張る。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22580","sourceWorkId":"29088","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/61/61568ee53b0a3004e43e9c583be9a43327fb6ff56548e82e9b1539a25483baed.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c5/c5964cbc2b324d1a59e50c4c36001ed3f4c1a3eb179bf650f8e018197deca60e.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"奥川 久美子","creatorId":"vndb:s861","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s861","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s861","name":"奥川 久美子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:79479","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c76174","characterName":"ゴン","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"77148","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"263799"}],"egsCharacterIds":["20709"],"vndbCharacterId":"c76174"},"originalCharacterName":"ゴン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"I serve Vanessa ’cause I want to, okay?! I always have... and always will!\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Neo-fennec no. 150."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Fearless and reliable, but loyal foremost to Vanessa. Despite Vanessa berating him daily, he seems to be more than okay with it..."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Steam"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c76174"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"個体番号はＮＦ150。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ヴァネッサに忠誠を誓っている精悍で実直な男。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"かなりのドＭ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ドレッドヘアーと銀色の毛なみが特徴のネオフェネック。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ヴァネッサからは日々怒鳴られつつも、きちんとお世話をされている模様。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20709","sourceWorkId":"27101","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"個体番号はNF150。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ヴァネッサに忠誠を誓っている精悍で実直な男。かなりのドM。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ドレッドヘアーと銀色の毛なみが特徴のネオフェネック。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ヴァネッサからは日々怒鳴られつつも、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"きちんとお世話をされている模様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「俺は俺の意志でヴァネッサに尽くす！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"771